		},
		{
			"id": "03d1d9ad47c50101",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/03-R-Type 的路徑.png",
			"x": -1467,
			"y": -1731,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 265
		},
		{
			"id": "73b7bd49549e7dca",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/14-Sw 路徑.png",
			"x": -1477,
			"y": 180,
			"width": 620,
			"height": 351
		},
		{
			"id": "693cd1fedb8053e4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "只是為了分步驟 single cycle machine 並沒有分步驟都是 one cycle",
			"x": -1408,
			"y": -1857,
			"width": 301,
			"height": 55,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "b96e2f5ff076a263",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/05-R-Type 的路徑.png",
			"x": -937,
			"y": -1725,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 253
		},
		{
			"id": "258eca17cd7fe2fa",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/10-R-Type 的路徑.png",
			"x": -1448,
			"y": -1165,
			"width": 448,
			"height": 253
		},
		{
			"id": "b66b0727cc3659ec",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 有四個沒有用到 MemRead, RegWrite, RegDst, MemtoReg\n\t- RegDst 因為沒有寫入 Reg 所以就是 Don't care\n\t- MemtoReg 也是 Don't care 因為不用 Write back\n\t- 其他都設成 0",
			"x": -1406,
			"y": 588,
			"width": 478,
			"height": 127,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "9687f987b2f9d437",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "其實會有 PC -> Instruction memory -> Sign extend -> MUX -> Data Memory 這條路線但是因為 Sign extend + MUX 時間一定比較短所以用 Reg 這個",
			"x": -608,
			"y": 600,
			"width": 316,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "58a17b34f712739b",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/12-Lw 路徑.png",
			"x": -1477,
			"y": -300,
			"width": 597,
			"height": 340
		},
		{
			"id": "e426020a4c04c65f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/09-R-Type 的路徑 - 控制流程.png",
			"x": -838,
			"y": -1168,
			"width": 455,
			"height": 256
		},
		{
			"id": "f173318ac44cc26a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- **主控制器**看 `opcode`，決定輸出 ALUOp。\n    \n    - R-type → ALUOp = `10`\n        \n    - beq → ALUOp = `01`\n        \n    - lw/sw → ALUOp = `00`\n        \n- **ALU Control**同時接收：\n    \n    - ALUOp (2 bits)\n        \n    - funct (6 bits, R-type 才有用)\n        \n- **ALU Control 輸出 4-bit/3-bit ALUCtrl**，告訴 ALU要做 `add/sub/and/or/slt`。",
			"x": -1542,
			"y": -859,
			"width": 635,
			"height": 245,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "b366189dd1dc34e3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "MemRead 和 MemWrite 都沒有使用到設定成 0",
			"x": -763,
			"y": -865,
			"width": 306,
			"height": 55,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "114e9660af41072c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 控制流程\n\n1. **Instruction memory** 讀出指令 → 上圖紅線分開各欄位。\n    \n2. **Control Unit** 看到 opcode=000000 → 輸出 `ALUOp=10`。\n    \n3. **Register File**\n    \n    - rs (25-21) → 讀 `$t1`\n        \n    - rt (20-16) → 讀 `$t2`\n        \n    - rd (15-11) → 當作目標暫存器地址（因為 RegDst=1）。\n        \n4. **ALU Control** 收到 ALUOp=10 + funct=100000 → 產生 ALUCtrl=0010 (代表加法)。\n    \n5. **ALU** 執行 `$t1 + $t2`，結果寫回 `$t0`。",
			"x": -237,
			"y": -754,
			"width": 539,
			"height": 315
		},
		{
			"id": "bbe45ca739679989",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/04-R-Type 的路徑.png",
			"x": -457,
			"y": -1728,
			"width": 456,
			"height": 259
		},
		{
			"id": "7fc40ef9217547fc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "ALUSrc 0 才能知道是從 Reg 過來給 ALU 去計算的",
			"x": -353,
			"y": -1425,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "61c8a1dc70ada0e1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/13-Lw 路徑.png",
			"x": -757,
			"y": -300,
			"width": 604,
			"height": 340
		},
		{
			"id": "eb0347b17a472195",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/15-Sw 路徑.png",
			"x": -757,
			"y": 180,
			"width": 614,
			"height": 351
		},
		{
			"id": "7c683e2f23ee8b88",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/16-Beq 路徑.png",
			"x": -1463,
			"y": 810,
			"width": 536,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "e3b741b63c2a37bf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "這很重要要記得",
			"x": 567,
			"y": -840,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "6838e19b35cd2370",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_第四章重要/08-Single cycle machine.png",
			"x": 163,
			"y": 216,
			"width": 1122,
			"height": 507
		},
		{
			"id": "32b738801852e226",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_第四章重要/07-Single cycle machine.png",
			"x": 174,
			"y": -300,
			"width": 1140,
			"height": 376
		},
		{
			"id": "c418ce07572c9e18",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "有時候會把 MUX 的 0 1 對調要記住",
			"x": 583,
			"y": 836,
			"width": 284,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "87e899a912009ab4",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_第四章重要/02-Single Cycle machine.png",
			"x": 163,
			"y": 960,
			"width": 1184,
			"height": 520
		},
		{
			"id": "ed3ab6f8f58529a0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 拿 `add $t0, $t1, $t2` 舉例\n\n意思是：`$t0 = $t1 + $t2`\n\n- **opcode [31-26] = 000000** → 主控制器判斷這是 R-type。\n    \n- **rs [25-21] = $t1** → 第一個來源暫存器。\n    \n- **rt [20-16] = $t2** → 第二個來源暫存器。\n    \n- **rd [15-11] = $t0** → 結果要寫回的目的暫存器。\n    \n- **shamt [10-6] = 00000** → 移位量，對 add 沒用。\n    \n- **funct [5-0] = 100000 (32)** → ALU Control 看這個，決定是「做加法」。",
			"x": -237,
			"y": -1203,
			"width": 478,
			"height": 326
		},
		{
			"id": "b7a2babb41c51b83",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/08-R-Type 的路徑 - 控制流程.png",
			"x": 463,
			"y": -1190,
			"width": 457,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "e3bdef3d12f6e22c",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/02-無條件.png",
			"x": 3471,
			"y": -2046,
			"width": 788,
			"height": 480
		},
		{
			"id": "c253cacf0acf2179",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_4_Single_cycle_machine_performancce/07-無條件.png",
			"x": 3865,
			"y": -1330,
			"width": 878,
			"height": 440
		},
		{
			"id": "b2a33e7f97a56551",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "無條件",
			"x": 3471,
			"y": -1140,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "89150b40bcc25e79",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "有條件，因為有測條件更久",
			"x": 3471,
			"y": -416,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "8f8a1de032f29722",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "因為沒有使用到 RegDst, MemoToReg, 和 MemR/W, RegWrite 五個控制訊號線，但是因為 RegWrite 都變成 0 了所以 MemToReg 和 RegDst 變成 Don't care",
			"x": -1397,
			"y": 1170,
			"width": 404,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "aa0eac5041ff6c45",
